    "slug": "jcurve-completes-trademark-registration-for-nobb",
    "title": "J-Curve Interactive completes trademark registration for its brand NOBB",
    "excerpt": "J-Curve registers its smartphone-accessory brand NOBB to protect its identity and support its street-brand direction.",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><img src=\"http://intra.j-curve.co.kr/data/editor/2202/166e32b45c8380b11ccd7df89a5e912d_1646016934_7893.png\" title=\"166e32b45c8380b11ccd7df89a5e912d_1646016934_7893.png\" alt=\"166e32b45c8380b11ccd7df89a5e912d_1646016934_7893.png\"><br style=\"clear:both;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">Hello, we are J-Curve Interactive :)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">We are pleased to announce completion of our brand's trademark registration!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"> We distribute smartphone cases and accessories through </span><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">our own brand, NOBB.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"> We registered the trademark to support its image, product quality and differentiation.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"> Many business owners already understand the importance of trademark registration.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"> It is essential for brand rights and legal protection.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"> Registering NOBB's trademark was a project in the highly competitive smartphone-accessory market</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"> to establish our own identity.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"> As a performance-advertising agency, we created NOBB to build expertise extending into distribution and e-commerce.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"><br></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"> Under the slogan “Not Ordinary But Basically,” expressing the extraordinary within the ordinary, we go beyond smartphone cases </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">to develop a homegrown Korean street brand. </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">Drawing on years of marketing expertise and experience operating various online media channels, </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">we continue growing the brand.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"> J-Curve is still working steadily toward growth :)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span> </p>",
    "meta_title": "J-Curve completes trademark registration for NOBB",
    "meta_description": "J-Curve registers its smartphone-accessory brand NOBB to protect its identity and support its street-brand direction."
  },
  "ja": {
    "slug": "jcurve-completes-trademark-registration-for-nobb",
    "title": "J-Curve Interactive、自社ブランド「NOBB」の商標登録が完了",
    "excerpt": "スマートフォン用品ブランドNOBBの商標を登録し、独自性とストリートブランドとしての展開を支えます。",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><img src=\"http://intra.j-curve.co.kr/data/editor/2202/166e32b45c8380b11ccd7df89a5e912d_1646016934_7893.png\" title=\"166e32b45c8380b11ccd7df89a5e912d_1646016934_7893.png\" alt=\"166e32b45c8380b11ccd7df89a5e912d_1646016934_7893.png\"><br style=\"clear:both;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">こんにちは。J-Curve Interactiveです :)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">当社ブランドの商標登録が完了したという、うれしいお知らせです。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">スマートフォンケースや関連用品を販売する </span><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">自社ブランドNOBBを運営しています。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">ブランドのイメージ、品質、差別化のために登録しました。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">事業を営む多くの方は、商標登録の重要性をすでによくご存じだと思います。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">ブランドの権利と法的保護に欠かせません。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">競争の激しいスマートフォン用品市場での今回の登録は、</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">独自の個性を築くための取り組みです。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">パフォーマンス広告の運用代行を専門とする当社は、流通・ECまで専門性を広げるためにNOBBを立ち上げました。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"><br></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">「Not Ordinary But Basically」、平凡の中の非凡さを掲げ、単なるケースにとどまらず、 </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">韓国発のストリートブランドを目指しています。 </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">長年培ってきたマーケティングの専門性と多様なオンライン媒体の運用ノウハウを </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">基に、ブランドの成長を着実に続けています。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;line-height:1.6;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\">当社は今も成長に向け努力しています :)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span> </p>",
    "meta_title": "自社ブランドNOBBの商標登録が完了",
    "meta_description": "スマートフォン用品ブランドNOBBの商標を登録し、独自性とストリートブランドとしての展開を支えます。"
  }
}
